explanation.text:
Stream: page_views   {userId, pageId, ts}
Table:  user_profile {userId, country, tier}  ← CDC from database

Enrichment: for each page_view, look up user_profile[userId]

Output: {userId, pageId, ts, country, tier}

The table is kept current via CDC (Debezium → Kafka → state store).
No window needed: lookup is point-in-time at event arrival.
